<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's PFI Q1 pretax up 33 pct to NZ$2.1 mln.</title>
<headline>NZ's PFI Q1 pretax up 33 pct to NZ$2.1 mln.</headline>
<text>
<p>WELLINGTON, April 24, Reuter - Three months to March 31</p>
<p>				(million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 2.12 vs 1.59</p>
<p>    Net profit			    1.82 vs 1.36</p>
<p>    Rental income			 3.08 vs 1.94</p>
<p>    Net assets			   99.21 vs 69.81</p>
<p>NOTE - Property company Property for Industry Limited said its result made no allowance for property revaluations. It gave no per-share information.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
</text>
